    <string name="a11y_service_description">Open Flow uses Accessibility only to detect focused text fields and insert speech-to-text. It does not replace your keyboard. Speak as long as you want while the bubble is listening — sessions auto-restart after OS pauses. OpenFlow has no server and no analytics. Android system STT may process audio on-device or remotely depending on your device. Password fields skipped.</string>
